{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contractionHierarchy"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"witnessLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 500, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ContractionHierarchy","preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths20ContractionHierarchyV","identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/ContractionHierarchy"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices a witness search may settle before giving up on ruling a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shortcut out. A budget too small for the graph’s structure lets shortcuts pile up, each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contraction then costing more than the last; the default suits road-like and grid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graphs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"witnessLimit"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The length of the edge at a position.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"weight"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Building it contracts every vertex, each contraction adding the shortcuts that keep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distances among the vertices still to come; a shortcut is ruled out by an arc that already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"joins its endpoints at its weight or less, or by a witness search that settles at most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"witnessLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" vertices, so a smaller limit builds faster and adds more shortcuts. Parallel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edges count by their cheapest; self-loops are ignored. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the weights are kept."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n log n + m) plus the witness searches, O(witnessLimit · log n) for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair of arcs through a contracted vertex; the shortcuts are O(n²) in the worst case and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a small multiple of m on road-like graphs."}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every weight is at least ","type":"text"},{"code":".zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and not NaN; every sum fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"W","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":";","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"witnessLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is at least zero.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/contractionHierarchy(witnessLimit:weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/contractionhierarchy(witnesslimit:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A contraction hierarchy over the graph with these weights, for repeated shortest-path","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries between arbitrary pairs of vertices.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"contractionHierarchy(witnessLimit:weight:)","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/ContractionHierarchy.swift#L495","fileName":"ContractionHierarchy.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P13ShortestPathsE20contractionHierarchy12witnessLimit6weightAD011ContractionG0Vyxqd__GSi_qd__5Edges_5IndexQZXEts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contractionHierarchy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"witnessLimit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContractionHierarchy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths20ContractionHierarchyV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/GraphProtocols":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/graphprotocols","title":"GraphProtocols"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/Edges-swift.associatedtype":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/edges-swift.associatedtype","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"symbol","title":"Edges","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Collection","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl"}]},"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/ContractionHierarchy":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/ContractionHierarchy","title":"ContractionHierarchy","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ContractionHierarchy","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A contraction hierarchy (Geisberger, Sanders, Schultes and Delling, “Contraction hierarchies:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"faster and simpler hierarchical routing in road networks”, WEA 2008) over a graph and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weights: the vertices contracted one at a time in a heuristic order, each contraction adding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the shortcuts that keep every distance among the vertices still to come, and each query two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"searches that only climb, from the source along arcs to higher-ranked vertices and from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target backward along arcs from higher-ranked ones, meeting on a shortest path."}],"url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/contractionhierarchy","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContractionHierarchy","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","title":"DirectedGraph"},"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/contractionHierarchy(witnessLimit:weight:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/contracti